+## Usage reported to afterModelResponse
+
+- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits, and receives the sum of the token counts reported across every provider call in that turn ([validated by: reports the sum of three provider calls when a turn runs two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L56)).
+- For a turn that ran no tools, that sum is the single provider call's usage unchanged ([validated by: receives collected response text and usage](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L236)).
+- Rounds that report no usage are skipped without zeroing or poisoning the sum with `undefined` or `NaN`, and a turn in which no round reported usage still passes `undefined` ([validated by: counts the rounds that reported usage when one round reports none, and reports nothing when no round did](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L75)).
+
